      "content": "idk, i just feel like you're dismissing what i'm actually experiencing. people at the lab were really weird about it too—they wouldn't look me in the eye when i asked about the \"minor leak\" results. if it was just a \"psychological thing,\" why would they act so secretive? it feels like there's a real physical mechanism here that they just aren't ready to admit exists. if i can explain the physics of how a localized particle stream could theoretically interact with the optic nerve to create a sensory bridge to quantum states, would you at least consider it as a mathematical possibility?",
